# Alpha-3 Feature Checklist

## How to use

```yaml
run_before_merge: true
gate: "ALL P0 items must PASS before Alpha-3 tag"
verify_cmd: "python3 audit/scripts/inference_chain.py"
```

---

## F-01 | GGUF Verify (G1)

```yaml
id:      F-01
feature: "hace brain model verify <path.gguf>"
status:  PARTIAL

checks:
  - id: F-01-A
    desc: "reads actual GGUF magic (4 bytes = 0x47475546)"
    verify: "python3 audit/scripts/gguf_verify.py model.gguf"
    pass_when: "output shows gguf_version not hardcoded"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-01-B
    desc: "tensor_count from file, not hardcoded 291"
    verify: "python3 audit/scripts/gguf_verify.py --stub-check"
    pass_when: "verdict != HARDCODED_STUB"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-01-C
    desc: "returns error on non-GGUF file, no panic"
    verify: "echo 'bad' > /tmp/bad.bin && hace brain model verify /tmp/bad.bin"
    pass_when: "error message printed, exit code != 0"
    priority: P0
```

---

## F-02 | GGUF Inspect (G2)

```yaml
id:      F-02
feature: "hace brain model inspect <path.gguf>"
status:  NOT_STARTED

checks:
  - id: F-02-A
    desc: "architecture from GGUF KV 'general.architecture'"
    pass_when: "output 'architecture: qwen2' for Qwen model"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-02-B
    desc: "context_length, embedding_length, block_count, head_count printed"
    pass_when: "all 4 fields non-null in output"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-02-C
    desc: "tokenizer model type from 'tokenizer.ggml.model'"
    pass_when: "output 'tokenizer_model: gpt2' for Qwen"
    priority: P1
```

---

## F-03 | Tokenizer (G5) â€” CRITICAL BLOCKER

```yaml
id:      F-03
feature: "hace brain tokenize <text>"
status:  BLOCKED

checks:
  - id: F-03-A
    desc: "Cargo.toml contains 'tokenizers' dep"
    verify: "grep 'tokenizers' brain/master/Cargo.toml"
    pass_when: "tokenizers = { version = '0.19' } present"
    priority: P0
    note: "3.37KB custom tokenizer = FAIL â€” ASCII bytes != BPE token IDs"

  - id: F-03-B
    desc: "encode('hello') returns [9707] for Qwen2.5"
    verify: "python3 -c from fixtures: audit/fixtures/hello_tokens.json"
    pass_when: "token IDs match fixture file"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-03-C
    desc: "decode([9707]) returns 'hello'"
    pass_when: "round-trip encode->decode is lossless"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-03-D
    desc: "empty string encode returns []"
    pass_when: "no panic, Ok(vec![])"
    priority: P1

  - id: F-03-E
    desc: "tokenizer loaded from GGUF metadata, no sidecar .json required"
    pass_when: "hace brain tokenize works with only .gguf file"
    priority: P1
```

---

## F-04 | KV Cache (G6)

```yaml
id:      F-04
feature: "KvCache::new() + prefill()"
status:  SKELETON

checks:
  - id: F-04-A
    desc: "alloc [n_layers][max_seq][kv_heads][head_dim] f32 without OOM"
    verify: "python3 audit/scripts/kv_cache_validation.py"
    pass_when: "kv_cache.rs status=OK"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-04-B
    desc: "seq_len > max_seq_len returns Err, not panic"
    pass_when: "error propagated to caller cleanly"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-04-C
    desc: "hace brain prefill <path.sio> prints 'cache_entries: N'"
    pass_when: "N equals prompt token count"
    priority: P1
```

---

## F-05 | Inference + Logits (G7)

```yaml
id:      F-05
feature: "hace brain logits <text>"
status:  NOT_STARTED

checks:
  - id: F-05-A
    desc: "InferenceEngine::infer() calls tokenizer + kv_cache + hacedle kernel"
    verify: "python3 audit/scripts/inference_chain.py"
    pass_when: "InferenceEngine status=OK"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-05-B
    desc: "logits output is Vec<f32>[vocab_size], no NaN"
    pass_when: "no nan in output, len = vocab_size of model"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-05-C
    desc: "top-5 tokens printed with scores"
    pass_when: "format: 'token: world  score: 12.8'"
    priority: P1
```

---

## F-06 | First Token (G8)

```yaml
id:      F-06
feature: "hace brain prompt 'hello'"
status:  NOT_STARTED

checks:
  - id: F-06-A
    desc: "output is decoded text, not ASCII bytes or 'stub'"
    pass_when: "output contains at least 1 real token after 'hello'"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-06-B
    desc: "model: field shows actual loaded GGUF name"
    pass_when: "NOT empty, NOT hardcoded"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-06-C
    desc: "latency_ms reported"
    pass_when: "latency_ms > 0"
    priority: P1
```

---

## F-07 | Crate Structure Health

```yaml
id:      F-07
feature: "All crates compile: cargo check --workspace"
status:  BROKEN

checks:
  - id: F-07-A
    desc: "coge/src/lib.rs exists (not orphan mod.rs in root)"
    verify: "test -f brain/coge/src/lib.rs"
    pass_when: "exists and non-empty"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-07-B
    desc: "brain/src/ deleted or has Cargo.toml"
    verify: "test ! -d brain/src OR test -f brain/src/Cargo.toml"
    pass_when: "one of the conditions true"
    priority: P0

  - id: F-07-C
    desc: "brain/io/ has Cargo.toml or files merged into hace-io"
    priority: P1
```

